{"ticker":"544844","symbol":"5441741","instrumentId":3203567,"name":"Poojaa Precision Engg Ltd","industry":"BSE-Auto/Truck-Original Eqp","about":"\"Poojaa Precision Engg is an end-to-end manufacturer of precision aluminium castings. The company operates 4 manufacturing plants and offers gravity, low-pressure and high-pressure die casting, heat treatment and machining capabilities.\n\nIts products serve three key segments—automotive, non-automotive and e-mobility. The portfolio includes cylinder heads, intake manifolds, timing covers, alternator brackets, transmission casings, compressor pistons, gearbox housings, gas insulator components and X-ray machine parts.\n\nThe company supplies lightweight, precision-engineered components for passenger vehicles, electric vehicles, agriculture, industrial equipment, electrical infrastructure and healthcare applications, supporting customers with customised engineering and manufacturing solutions.\"","website":"www.poojacastings.in","location":null,"exchange":"BSE","fetchedAt":"2026-11-20T13:49:39.137Z","basis":"standalone","price":{"value":880.4,"changePct":-3.369553287235215,"week52High":1009.15,"week52Low":0},"stats":[{"label":"Market capitalization","value":"₹1,756 Cr"},{"label":"Sales","value":"₹504 Cr"},{"label":"Shares in float","value":"7,778,000"},{"label":"No. of funds","value":"25"},{"label":"Shares held by funds","value":"1,212,800"},{"label":"Dividend yield","value":"0.00%"},{"label":"Book value","value":"9.68"},{"label":"U/D vol ratio","value":"1.4"},{"label":"LTDebt / equity","value":"15.0%"},{"label":"Alpha","value":"0.86"},{"label":"Beta","value":"0.87"},{"label":"EPS growth rate","value":"4%"},{"label":"P/E ratio","value":"37.12"},{"label":"5-year P/E range","value":"—"},{"label":"Return on equity","value":"25.1%"},{"label":"Cash flow (INR)","value":"14.83"},{"label":"Volume","value":"59,000"},{"label":"Avg volume (50d)","value":"88,996"},{"label":"Master score","value":"66"},{"label":"EPS rating","value":"98